1. Improved tensile strength: The addition of GO can significantly increase the tensile strength of polyethylene-based nanocomposites. This is because the strong interaction between the GO sheets and the polymer matrix leads to efficient stress transfer from the matrix to the GO, resulting in enhanced load-bearing capacity.

