\[
a_5 = 19 + (5-1)F = 19 + 4F > 0 \implies 4F > -19 \implies F > -\frac{19}{4} = -4.75
\]
Since $F$ is an integer, $F \geq -5$.

Combining these two conditions, we have $-5 \leq F \leq -4$. Since $F$ is an integer, the only possible values are $F = -5$ or $F = -4$.

