$4 \sin^2 B - \sqrt{2} \cos B \sin B - \sqrt{2} \sin^2 B = 1$
$4 \sin^2 B - \sqrt{2} \sin B \cos B - \sqrt{2} \sin^2 B = 1$
$4 \sin^2 B - \sqrt{2} \sin B \cos B - \sqrt{2} \sin^2 B - 1 = 0$

