   For laminar flow on a flat plate, the Nusselt number is:  
   \[
   Nu = 0.023 \text{ Re}^{0.5} \text{Pr}^{0.333}
   \]  
   For air at 50°C, the kinematic viscosity \( \nu = 1.1 \times 10^{-5} \text{ m}^2/\text{s} \).  
   The Prandtl number \( Pr = \frac{\mu c_p}{\rho c_v} \). For air at 50°C, \( Pr \approx 0.66 \).  
