     where:
     - \( D = 4 \, \text{cm} = 0.04 \, \text{m} \)
     - \( \Delta Q = 0.02 \, \text{m}^3/\text{s} \)

   - Substituting the values:
     \[
     f = \frac{1}{8} \left( \frac{4 \times 10^3}{0.04 \times 0.02} \right)^{2/3} = \frac{1}{8} (2000000)^{2/3} = \frac{1}{8} \times 181.8 \approx 22.7 \, \text{m/s}
